  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "gv-761446-b00001",
      "text": "This week, we take a deep dive into research from the Civic Media Observatory, where Daria Dergacheva tells us about the CMO's analysis of Vkontakte, a Russia-only social network. The research looked at how, in one of the few “public” spaces left to Russians in Russia, members responded to posts about the war, and terms and iconography associated with it. In a follow up post to the analysis discussed here, the CMO looked at how Ukrainians were using the same site to inform Russians about the war.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 501,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2022/04/04/war-is-war-vkontakte-users-discuss-the-russian-invasion-of-ukraine/",
        "https://globalvoices.org/2022/04/15/ukrainians-use-vkontakte-marketplaces-to-inform-russians-about-the-war/",
        "https://globalvoices.org/author/daria-dergacheva/",
        "https://globalvoices.org/special/observatory/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-761446-b00002",
      "text": "The Global Voices Podcast brings you local news from all over the world. Each week, insiders from our community share what news matters more in their communities and how they build their stories out of the local context. Listen now for your weekly dose of global news in local voices.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 503,
      "body_end": 787,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-761446-b00003",
      "text": "If you enjoyed this episode, please subscribe and tell your friends about us! You can follow us on Twitter. The music in this podcast is from the track “Voyage” by NikMartken, from our extended Global Voices community.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 789,
      "body_end": 1007,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/-/special/global-voices-podcast/",
        "https://open.spotify.com/track/56rJnVs9wyFkAYM5fK40x6?si=54d17df81b114b74",
        "https://twitter.com/globalvoices"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-761446-b00004",
      "text": "For more information about this topic, see our special coverage Russia invades Ukraine.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 1009,
      "body_end": 1096,
